#ASSERT `How many days of annual leave do I get` (`leave service` 6 1 6 FALSE) EQUALS 4

#ASSERT `How many days of paid sick leave can I take` (`sick facts` 6 TRUE FALSE 0) EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `How many days of paid sick leave can I take` (`sick facts` 6 TRUE TRUE 10) EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `How many days of paid sick leave can I take` (`sick facts` 6 TRUE TRUE 100) EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `How many days of paid sick leave can I take` (`sick facts` 36 FALSE FALSE 0) EQUALS 0

